      "writtenOn": "2021-06-25T20:27:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "nit: as a matter of personal preference which you are completely and totally welcome to disregard, I tend to like grouping all the bit meanings with their registers.  You can do this either by physically locating them by the register they relate to, or including the register name in the bit name so it\u0027s clear which bits belong where.  It can also help to define enums if they represent values within a field, and BIT() or GENMASK() when they represent a field itself.",
